[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:83. Going on Holiday]
[00:01.100]Lesson 83 | 第83课
[00:02.820]Hello, John. Come in. | 你好，约翰。进来。
[00:05.990]Hello, John. | 你好，约翰。
[00:07.680]We're having lunch. | 我们正在吃午饭。
[00:09.255]Do you want to have lunch with us? | 你想和我们一起吃午饭吗？
[00:11.255]No, thank you, Tom. | 不用了，谢谢你，汤姆。
[00:12.750]I've already had lunch. | 我已经吃过午饭了。
[00:14.525]I had lunch at half past twelve. | 我十二点半吃的午饭。
[00:17.005]Have a cup of coffee then. | 那就喝杯咖啡吧。
[00:18.820]I've just had a cup, thank you. | 我刚喝了一杯，谢谢。
[00:20.835]I had one after my lunch. | 我午饭后喝了一杯。
[00:23.290]Let's go into the living room, Peggy. | 佩吉，我们进客厅去吧。
[00:25.895]We can have our coffee there. | 我们可以在那里喝咖啡。
[00:28.405]Excuse the mess, John. | 约翰，请原谅这里很乱。
[00:31.180]This room's very untidy. | 这个房间非常不整洁。
[00:33.585]We're packing our suitcases. | 我们正在收拾行李。
[00:35.760]We're going to leave tomorrow. | 我们明天要走了。
[00:37.745]Tom and I are going to have a holiday. | 汤姆和我要去度假。
[00:40.570]Aren't you lucky. | 你真幸运！
[00:42.675]When are you going to have a holiday, John? | 约翰，你什么时候去度假？
[00:45.485]I don't know. | 我不知道。
[00:46.970]I've already had my holiday this year. | 我今年已经度过假了。
[00:49.645]Where did you go? | 你去哪里了？
[00:51.405]I stayed at home. | 我待在家里。